@startuml
title Bounds-based catalog map search

actor "EV_USER" as EvUser
participant "frontend" as Frontend
participant "nginx-gateway" as Gateway
participant "catalog-service" as Catalog
database "catalog-postgres" as CatalogDb

EvUser -> Frontend : Move map or change filters
Frontend -> Frontend : Build viewport bounds query
Frontend -> Gateway : GET /api/catalog/points?minLat=...&maxLat=...&minLng=...&maxLng=...&zoom=...
Gateway -> Catalog : GET /points with bounds
Catalog -> CatalogDb : Query active catalog_points in bounds
Catalog --> Gateway : Normalized point list and freshness metadata
Gateway --> Frontend : Point list
Frontend --> EvUser : Render map/list without provider API calls

EvUser -> Frontend : Select point
Frontend -> Gateway : GET /api/catalog/points/{provider_code}/{external_point_id}
Gateway -> Catalog : GET cached point detail
Catalog -> CatalogDb : Load catalog point projection
Catalog --> Gateway : Cached point detail
Gateway --> Frontend : Cached point detail

@enduml
